@startuml
title Remark（STW）的五类重扫来源
skinparam defaultFontName "WenQuanYi Micro Hei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam backgroundColor white
left to right direction

rectangle "根集合\n栈 / 寄存器 / 全局 / JNI" as R1 #LightYellow
rectangle "年轻代\n整体作为根" as R2 #LightYellow
rectangle "mod-union 表\n本轮所有脏过卡" as R3 #LightBlue
rectangle "当前卡表\n仍为脏的卡" as R4 #LightBlue
rectangle "灰队列\n增量更新 / 未完成标记" as R5 #LightGray
rectangle "引用队列\n软 / 弱 / 虚 / finalizer" as R6 #Pink

rectangle "Remark（STW）\n最终存活判定" as RM #LightCoral
rectangle "完整存活位图\n进入 Concurrent Sweep" as OUT #LightGreen

R1 --> RM
R2 --> RM
R3 --> RM
R4 --> RM
R5 --> RM
R6 --> RM
RM --> OUT
note right of RM
  CMSScavengeBeforeRemark=true 时
  先做一次 Young GC，缩小根集合
end note
@enduml
